<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 21 个信源（18 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:40:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.6 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.6</link><description>托管会话现在可在等待工具审批、提问或 Hooks/MCP 决策时挂起，即使 Harness 重启也能通过冷恢复继续执行。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:55:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b3a5ecb86fe232470585f10d3f85236c4726ca44</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.6">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.7 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.7</link><description>Qwen Code CLI 登陆 Harness 内核，用量统计默认关闭，重复工具调用被拒时会给出更清楚的说明。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:08:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a1411dc283e3ca5ac44554c0991e7e0b2e266426</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.7">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>基于 Nemotron 3.5 Parse 构建：开放数据、微调与更快推理</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/building-on-nemotron-35-parse-open-data-fine-tunin</link><description>英伟达文档解析模型 Nemotron 3.5 Parse 的实战分享：公开训练数据、微调方法与推理加速，帮开发者把文档解析接到自己的流程里。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:05:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d3aa48daa62df5852a1b067eacae1265bc9a1872</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/building-on-nemotron-35-parse-open-data-fine-tunin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code SDK TypeScript v0.1.36 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.36</link><description>Qwen Code 的 TypeScript SDK 发布 v0.1.36，内置 CLI 0.28.6，方便开发者直接在项目里调用 Qwen Code 的能力。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:46:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b918abbae4eccac48ab9b3dfc0679c4f84e2526a</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.36">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>llama.cpp 基准看板上线，覆盖 AMD Ryzen 与 Radeon</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/ggml-org/llamacpp-amd-bench</link><description>Hugging Face 上线公开看板，可按硬件、模型与量化方式对比 llama.cpp 在 AMD Ryzen 和 Radeon 上的提示处理与生成速度，并追踪各版本的性能变化。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:37:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">02a088434703556c0ebb46d05bae744860572362</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/ggml-org/llamacpp-amd-bench">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>用开发者交给 Kiro 的真实工作评测编程智能体</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/kirobench</link><description>Kiro 公开了内部评测集 KiroBench：300 多道任务取自亚马逊工程师的真实开发工作，覆盖功能开发、修 Bug、重构等多轮场景，用可运行环境加验证器打分，以避开公开基准的题目泄露与覆盖面过窄问题。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3e370caedb76941d16ca9046cae2261c291d1dba</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/kirobench">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>科学家为 AI 智能体划出界线</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents</link><description>科学家们讨论 AI 智能体在科研中可以走多远、哪些红线不能碰，为智能体的自主权划出一条参考边界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:52:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">37b5c9ba932667510c47b67a8eaf7e479db38e02</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>围绕人类注意力打造软件工厂</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/software-factory-human-attention</link><description>Kiro 团队分享一年实践：让智能体自主跑完从需求发现到上线监控的完整开发流程，并把这套操作手册开源出来，人只在真正需要决策的地方介入。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a7511ef2aa17d4634e8e6488463693d6f521b4cb</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/software-factory-human-attention">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenCode v2.4.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2</link><description>开源 AI 编程智能体 OpenCode 发布 v2.4.2 维护版本，本次未附详细更新说明。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:37:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0c5213ef953e1b494d249e22f829c22fb597f78e</guid><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2">OpenCode Releases</source></item><item><title>SDK v0.2.2</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.2</link><description>Cline SDK v0.2.2 发布，清理内部遥测代码，精简相关导出与依赖。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:40:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bc0403b660896832134ba9c9fcbe482244d6a315</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.2">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Mellum2.1 Instruct 发布，为编程智能体带来更快响应</title><link>https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents</link><description>JetBrains 推出 Mellum2.1 的轻量同门版本，面向子智能体、工具调用循环与对话场景，响应速度更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7dbdf429413629f189eae2b42d601ea3a4884729</guid><source url="https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents">JetBrains AI Blog</source></item><item><title>Cline 桌面版 v0.0.51</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/desktop-v0.0.51</link><description>Cline 桌面应用发布 v0.0.51 维护版本。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:34:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ffe2cb9ed2c316c594497776defd7b5b9a31c734</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/desktop-v0.0.51">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline v4.1.28 发布</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/v4.1.28</link><description>Cline 发布 v4.1.28，刷新模型目录，OpenAI 供应商不再列出上游已标记废弃的模型编号。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:57:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6aa9757abc1bc016b6394f6668dbff50b8f32995</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/v4.1.28">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.74.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.74.0 在核心中加入计算机操作工具契约，智能体可以直接调用 ComputerTool 完成电脑操作。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0f7a3c43cc177f44de084d995ed5d535246a68af</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>用 CUGA 打造印度语语音智能体</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga</link><description>IBM Research 用开源智能体框架 CUGA 做了一个面向印度农民的语音助手：用本地语言口头提问，它检索英文农业手册后用同种语言语音作答，关键在于用多语言嵌入模型解决跨语言检索。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:22:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d0a3a7f662b58965bac4af6309f496652b034a9c</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>在一块 RTX PRO 6000 上爬坡优化 Inkling 2 Mini 推理</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb</link><description>通过爬坡调优，让 Inkling 2 Mini 在单块 RTX PRO 6000 上的推理跑得更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d8d6777ecf09078330b26ef4bab0c3d0c914ff72</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Cline CLI v3.0.76</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/cli-v3.0.76</link><description>Cline CLI v3.0.76 在 npm 包根目录统一附带一份覆盖全部平台二进制文件的第三方声明，内置模型目录同步刷新，OpenAI 选择器不再显示上游已下架的模型。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:56:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4f717990edd7c87a863e2d900858d943d10fbd52</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/cli-v3.0.76">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v1.107.11 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11</link><description>Pydantic AI 1.x 分支迎来小版本更新，以常规修复为主。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">031724e287b2f316c2a726ed5cc4936da663b1ef</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.332 版本更新</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.332 支持从 MCP 服务器加载技能（测试版），并新增 PreSkillShellCommand 钩子，可在执行前拦截技能或命令的内联脚本。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:37:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">330d71ac80d9c0c0a46667c296959a0a855a7907</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.75.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0</link><description>新版收紧了工作区文件的指令权限，RepoContext、Skills 与 Memory 中的内容不再高于 operator 权限，并新增 lowest_authority_under 配置项。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">13285c6d2bd71e1c132078ffbdb3130712c854ed</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item></channel></rss>
